    'A Latino IT manager in his 40s reviews infrastructure in a cool blue-lit server room. LED ambient glow, professional focused expression, tech precision mood.',
    'A mature Latino business owner at a polished wood desk, reviewing documents under warm desk lamp. Bookshelves behind, evening atmosphere, intimate and accomplished.'
  ],
  social_proof: [
    'A large glass whiteboard covered with abstract colored workflow lines and circular nodes dominates the entire frame. Four Latino professionals stand around it from the side and behind, all studying the diagram. The process visualization is the clear protagonist. People are secondary observers, no face-to-face interaction.',
    'Overhead bird-eye shot of a wide conference table with an abstract process flow diagram as the central element. Three Latino professionals lean over it from different sides, all looking DOWN at the diagram, none facing each other. Table and workflow are the hero.',
