    'A small Latino operations team studies a minimalist process layout made from colored cords on a large table. Bright office, soft daylight, plain surfaces, no documents, no monitors, no readable marks.',
    'Two professionals stand a step back from a transparent acrylic board showing abstract colored workflow lines as pure shapes, viewed at a medium distance. The board has no symbols, letters, numbers, arrows, or labels. Hands at their sides, not the focus.',
