    'Minimal process workshop environment with a large empty table, colored cords forming a clean route, and blurred professionals in the background. Calm lower area for overlay, no readable details.'
  ],
  promesa: [
    'A confident Latina entrepreneur in her 30s stands on a rooftop terrace at golden hour, arms slightly open, Latin American city skyline stretching behind her. Cinematic warm light.',
